{"subject":"math3","year":2010,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2010-1","num":1,"desc":"极限计算","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C","【详解】$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{x}-\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x}-a\\right)e^{x}\\right]=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{1-e^{x}+axe^{x}}{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}-e^{x}+axe^{x}+ae^{x}$","$=-1+a=1\\therefore a=2$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-2","num":2,"desc":"一阶线性微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A","【详解】由题意知 $\\begin{cases}y_{1}'+p(x)y_{1}=q(x)&(1)\\\\ y_{2}'+p(x)y_{2}=q(x)&(2)\\end{cases}$.","由 $\\lambda y_{1}+\\mu y_{2}$ 是微分方程的解，将其带入微分方程得","$(\\lambda y_{1}'+\\mu y_{2}')+p(x)(\\lambda y_{1}+\\mu y_{2})=(\\lambda+\\mu)q(x)$，从而得，$\\lambda+\\mu=1$","同理将 $\\lambda y_{1}-\\mu y_{2}$ 带入微分方程得，$(\\lambda y_{1}'-\\mu y_{2}')+p(x)(\\lambda y_{1}-\\mu y_{2})=(\\lambda-\\mu)q(x)$","由 $\\lambda y_{1}-\\mu y_{2}$ 是对应齐次方程的解得 $\\lambda-\\mu=0$. 联立，$\\begin{cases}\\lambda+\\mu=1\\\\ \\lambda-\\mu=0\\end{cases}$ 解得 $\\lambda=\\dfrac{1}{2},\\mu=\\dfrac{1}{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-3","num":3,"desc":"复合函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】B","【详解】由题意知 $g'(x_{0})=0$. 因为 $\\left[f(g(x))\\right]''=f''(g(x))[g'(x)]^{2}+f'(g(x))g''(x)$, 所以","$f(g(x))$ 在 $x_{0}$ 取得极值的充分条件为","$f''(g(x_{0}))=f''(a)[g'(x_{0})]^{2}+f'(a)g''(x_{0})<0$","由 $g'(x_{0})=0$，$g''(x_{0})<0$, 知 $f'(a)>0$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-4","num":4,"desc":"无穷大阶的比较","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C","【详解】$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{f(x)}{g(x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln^{10}x}{x}=0<1\\therefore f(x)<g(x)$","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{g(x)}{h(x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{x}{e^{\\frac{x}{10}}}=0<1\\therefore g(x)<h(x)$","即 $f(x)<g(x)<h(x)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-5","num":5,"desc":"线性表示","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A","【详解】由向量组 I 线性无关知，$r(I)=r$，又向量组 II 的秩 $r(II)\\leqslant s$, 且 I 可由 II 表示，","则 $r=r(I)\\leqslant r(II)\\leqslant s$，即 $r\\leqslant s$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-6","num":6,"desc":"实对称矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】D","【详解】设 $A$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda$，则由 $A^{2}+A=0$ 可得 $\\lambda$ 满足关系式 $\\lambda^{2}+\\lambda=0$","即 $\\lambda(\\lambda+1)=0\\Rightarrow\\lambda=0$ 或 $\\lambda=-1$, 且 $A$ 为实对称矩阵，必可相似对角化.","又因为 $R(A)=3$, 对角阵的秩也是 3. 所以 $\\lambda=-1$ 是三重特征根，","故 $A\\sim\\begin{pmatrix}-1&&&\\\\&-1&&\\\\&&-1&\\\\&&&0\\end{pmatrix}$，所以正确答案为（D）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-7","num":7,"desc":"分布函数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C","【详解】","$P\\{X=1\\}=P\\{X\\leqslant1\\}-P\\{X<1\\}=F(1)-F(1-0)=1-e^{-1}-\\dfrac{1}{2}=\\dfrac{1}{2}-e^{-1}$. 所以选 C."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-8","num":8,"desc":"概率密度的性质","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A","【详解】由概率密度的性质 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x)dx=1$，有","$a\\int_{-\\infty}^{0}f_{1}(x)dx+b\\int_{0}^{3}f_{2}(x)dx=1\\Rightarrow\\dfrac{1}{2}a+\\dfrac{3}{4}b=1\\Rightarrow 2a+3b=4$. 所以选 A."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-9","num":9,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$-1$","【详解】两边同时对 $x$ 求导得，","$e^{-(x+y)^{2}}(1+y')=\\int_{0}^{x}\\sin t^{2}dt+x\\sin x^{2}$","将 $x=0$ 代入上式，得 $e^{-y^{2}}(1+y')=0,\\therefore y'=-1$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-10","num":10,"desc":"旋转体体积","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{\\pi^{2}}{4}$","【详解】$V=\\int_{e}^{+\\infty}\\pi\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x(1+\\ln^{2}x)}}\\right)^{2}dx$","令 $x=e^{t}$，则 $V=\\int_{1}^{+\\infty}\\pi\\dfrac{1}{e^{t}(1+t^{2})}\\cdot e^{t}dt=\\pi\\arctan t\\Big|_{1}^{+\\infty}=\\dfrac{\\pi^{2}}{4}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-11","num":11,"desc":"收益弹性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$pe^{\\frac{p^{3}-1}{3}}$","【详解】","由弹性函数得 $\\dfrac{dR}{dp}\\dfrac{p}{R}=1+p^{3}$，分离变量得 $\\dfrac{dR}{R}=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{p}+p^{2}\\right)dp$，于是 $\\ln R=\\ln p+\\dfrac{1}{3}p^{3}+C$，","带入初始条件 $R(1)=1$，得 $C=-\\dfrac{1}{3}$，从而得 $R=pe^{\\frac{p^{3}-1}{3}}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-12","num":12,"desc":"拐点","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$3$","【详解】由题设条件有 $0=(-1)^{3}+a(-1)^{2}+b(-1)+1$，且 $y''\\big|_{x=-1}=(6x+2a)\\big|_{x=-1}=0$","解得 $a=3$，$b=3$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-13","num":13,"desc":"行列式性质","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$3$","【详解】$\\left|A+B^{-1}\\right|=\\left|B^{-1}(BA+E)\\right|=\\left|B^{-1}(BA+A^{-1}A)\\right|$","$=\\left|B^{-1}(B+A^{-1})A\\right|=\\left|B^{-1}\\right|\\left|\\left(B+A^{-1}\\right)\\right|\\left|A\\right|=\\dfrac{1}{|B|}\\left|\\left(B+A^{-1}\\right)\\right|\\left|A\\right|$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\times2\\times3=3$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-14","num":14,"desc":"统计量的期望","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2}$","【详解】由题知 $EX=\\mu, DX=\\sigma^{2}\\Rightarrow EX^{2}=\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2}$, 则有","$ET=E(\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}X_{i}^{2})=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}EX_{i}^{2}=EX^{2}=\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-15","num":15,"desc":"指数对数变换求极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】","原式等于 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}e^{\\frac{1}{\\ln x}\\ln(x^{\\frac{1}{x}}-1)}=e^{\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\ln(e^{\\frac{\\ln x}{x}}-1)}{\\ln x}}=e^{A}$，","其中 $A=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln(e^{\\frac{\\ln x}{x}}-1)}{\\ln x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{1}{e^{\\frac{\\ln x}{x}}-1}\\cdot e^{\\frac{\\ln x}{x}}\\cdot\\dfrac{1-\\ln x}{x^{2}}}{\\dfrac{1}{x}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{e^{\\frac{\\ln x}{x}}-1}\\cdot e^{\\frac{\\ln x}{x}}\\cdot\\dfrac{1-\\ln x}{x}$","$=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{\\ln x}\\cdot\\dfrac{1-\\ln x}{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{1-\\ln x}{\\ln x}=-1$","所以原极限 $=e^{-1}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-16","num":16,"desc":"二重积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】积分区域 $D=D_{1}\\bigcup D_{2}$, 其中$D_{1}=\\left\\{(x,y)\\middle|0\\leqslant y\\leqslant1,\\sqrt{2}y\\leqslant x\\leqslant\\sqrt{1+y^{2}}\\right\\}$,","$D_{2}=\\left\\{(x,y)\\middle|-1\\leqslant y\\leqslant0,-\\sqrt{2}y\\leqslant x\\leqslant\\sqrt{1+y^{2}}\\right\\}$.","$\\iint\\limits_{D}(x+y)^{3}dxdy=\\iint\\limits_{D}\\left(x^{3}+3x^{2}y+3xy^{2}+y^{3}\\right)dxdy$,","因为区域 $D$ 关于 $x$ 轴对称，被积函数 $3x^{2}y+y^{3}$ 是 $y$ 的奇函数，所以","$\\iint\\limits_{D}\\left(3x^{2}y+y^{3}\\right)dxdy=0$.","$\\iint\\limits_{D}(x+y)^{3}dxdy=\\iint\\limits_{D}\\left(x^{3}+3xy^{2}\\right)dxdy=2\\iint\\limits_{D_{1}}\\left(x^{3}+3xy^{2}\\right)dxdy=2\\left[\\int_{0}^{1}dy\\int_{\\sqrt{2}y}^{\\sqrt{1+y^{2}}}\\left(x^{3}+3xy^{2}\\right)dx\\right]$","$=2\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4}x^{4}+\\dfrac{3}{2}x^{2}y^{2}\\right)\\Big|_{\\sqrt{2}y}^{\\sqrt{1+y^{2}}}dy=2\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(-\\dfrac{9}{4}y^{4}+2y^{2}+\\dfrac{1}{4}\\right)dy=\\dfrac{14}{15}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-17","num":17,"desc":"条件极值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】条件极值，构造拉格朗日函数.","$L(x,y,z,\\lambda)=xy+2yz+\\lambda(x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}-10)$.","$\\begin{cases}L_{x}=y+2\\lambda x=0\\\\ L_{y}=x+2z+2\\lambda y=0\\\\ L_{z}=2y+2\\lambda z=0\\\\ L_{\\lambda}=x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}-10=0\\end{cases}$","求解方程组得 $\\begin{cases}x_{1}=-1\\\\ y_{1}=\\sqrt{5}\\\\ z_{1}=-2\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x_{2}=-1\\\\ y_{2}=-\\sqrt{5}\\\\ z_{2}=-2\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x_{3}=1\\\\ y_{3}=\\sqrt{5}\\\\ z_{3}=2\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x_{4}=1\\\\ y_{4}=-\\sqrt{5}\\\\ z_{4}=2\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x_{5}=2\\sqrt{2}\\\\ y_{5}=0\\\\ z_{5}=-\\sqrt{2}\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x_{6}=-2\\sqrt{2}\\\\ y_{6}=0\\\\ z_{6}=\\sqrt{2}\\end{cases}$，","代入得，$M_{\\max}=1\\cdot\\sqrt{5}+2\\cdot\\sqrt{5}\\cdot2=5\\sqrt{5}$，$M_{\\min}=-1\\cdot\\sqrt{5}-2\\cdot\\sqrt{5}\\cdot2=-5\\sqrt{5}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-18","num":18,"desc":"定积分的大小比较","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】","（I）令 $f(t)=\\ln(1+t)-t$,","当 $0\\leqslant t\\leqslant1$ 时，$f'(t)=\\dfrac{1}{1+t}-1\\leqslant0$;","故当 $0\\leqslant t\\leqslant1$ 时 $f(t)\\leqslant f(0)=0$;","当 $0\\leqslant t\\leqslant1$ 时 $0\\leqslant\\ln(1+t)\\leqslant t$,","从而 $\\left(\\ln(1+t)\\right)^{n}\\leqslant t^{n}(n=1,2,\\cdots)$ 又由 $|\\ln t|\\geqslant0$.","得 $\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|\\left[\\ln(1+t)\\right]^{n}dt<\\int_{0}^{1}t^{n}|\\ln t|dt(n=1,2,\\cdots)$.","（II）$\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|t^{n}dt=-\\int_{0}^{1}(\\ln t)t^{n}dt=-(\\ln t)\\dfrac{1}{n+1}t^{n+1}\\Big|_{0}^{1}+\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{1}{n+1}t^{n}dt=\\dfrac{1}{(n+1)^{2}}$","$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|t^{n}dt=0$，又 $M_{n}>0$.","由夹逼定理得 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{0}^{1}|\\ln t|\\left[\\ln(1+t)\\right]^{n}dt=0$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-19","num":19,"desc":"介值定理","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】（I）设 $F(x)=\\int_{0}^{x}f(t)dt(0\\leqslant x\\leqslant2)$，则 $\\int_{0}^{2}f(x)dx=F(2)-F(0)$.","根据拉格朗日中值定理，存在 $\\eta\\in(0,2)$，使 $F(2)-F(0)=2F'(\\eta)=2f(\\eta)$.","由题设 $\\int_{0}^{2}f(x)dx=2f(0)$，从而 $f(\\eta)=f(0)$;","（II）由题可知 $\\dfrac{f(2)+f(3)}{2}$ 在 $f(2)$ 到 $f(3)$ 之间，所以由连续函数的介值定理有，存在","$\\xi_{0}\\in[2,3]$，使得 $f(\\xi_{0})=\\dfrac{f(2)+f(3)}{2}$，而 $\\dfrac{f(2)+f(3)}{2}=f(0)$,","又由（1）的结论有 $f(\\eta)=f(0), \\eta\\in(0,2)$，所以 $f(0)=f(\\eta)=f(\\xi_{0}), 0<\\eta<2\\leqslant\\xi_{0}\\leqslant3$","在区间 $(0,\\eta)$ 上，由罗尔定理有，存在 $\\xi_{1}\\in(0,\\eta)$, 使得 $f'(\\xi_{1})=0$，","在区间 $(\\eta,\\xi_{0})$ 上，由罗尔定理有，存在 $\\xi_{2}\\in(\\eta,\\xi_{0})$, 使得 $f'(\\xi_{2})=0$.","由于 $f'(\\xi_{1})=f'(\\xi_{2})=0$，所以在区间 $(\\xi_{1},\\xi_{2})$ 上，由罗尔定理有，存在 $\\xi\\in(\\xi_{1},\\xi_{2})$, 使得","$f''(\\xi)=0$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-20","num":20,"desc":"非齐次线性方程组","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】（I）由 $A\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 存在 2 个不同的解，可知 $R(A)=R(A\\!:\\!\\boldsymbol{b})<3$.","对 $A\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 的增广矩阵做初等行变换，","$\\overline{A}=(A\\!:\\!\\boldsymbol{b})=\\left(\\begin{array}{cccc}\\lambda&1&1\\!:&a\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0\\!:&1\\\\ 1&1&\\lambda\\!:&1\\end{array}\\right)\\xrightarrow{r_{1}\\leftrightarrow r_{3}}\\left(\\begin{array}{cccc}1&1&\\lambda\\!:&1\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0\\!:&1\\\\ \\lambda&1&1\\!:&a\\end{array}\\right)$","$\\xrightarrow{r_{3}-\\lambda r_{1}}\\left(\\begin{array}{ccccc}1&1&\\lambda&:&1\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0&:&1\\\\ 0&1-\\lambda&1-\\lambda^{2}&:&a-\\lambda\\end{array}\\right)\\xrightarrow{r_{3}+r_{2}}\\left(\\begin{array}{ccccc}1&1&\\lambda&:&1\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&0&:&1\\\\ 0&0&1-\\lambda^{2}&:&a+1-\\lambda\\end{array}\\right)$","所以 $\\begin{cases}1-\\lambda^{2}=0\\\\ a+1-\\lambda=0\\end{cases}$，解得 $\\lambda=1, a=0$ （舍去）；$\\lambda=-1, a=-2$.","（II）由（I）知，$\\overline{A}=\\left(\\begin{array}{cccc}1&1&-1\\!:&1\\\\ 0&-2&0\\!:&1\\\\ 0&0&0\\!:&0\\end{array}\\right)\\to\\left(\\begin{array}{cccc}1&0&-1\\!:&1.5\\\\ 0&1&0\\!:&-0.5\\\\ 0&0&0\\!:&0\\end{array}\\right)$.","$R(A)=R(\\overline{A})=2$, 对应齐次线性方程组 $A\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的基础解系含 1 个解向量, 即 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$,","$A\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 的一个特解为 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{3}{2}\\\\ -\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}$, $A\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{b}$ 的通解为 $k\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{3}{2}\\\\ -\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}$（其中 $k$ 为任意常数）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-21","num":21,"desc":"特征值与特征向量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】由于 $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$ 是 $Q$ 的第一列，所以 $\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$ 是 $A$ 的一个特征向量，设其所属特征值为","$\\lambda_{1}$，则 $A\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\lambda_{1}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$，即 $\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&4\\\\ -1&3&a\\\\ 4&a&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\ 5+a\\\\ 4+2a\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\lambda_{1}\\\\ 2\\lambda_{1}\\\\ \\lambda_{1}\\end{pmatrix}$.","所以 $\\begin{cases}\\lambda_{1}=2\\\\ 2\\lambda_{1}=5+a\\\\ \\lambda_{1}=4+2a\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}\\lambda_{1}=2\\\\ a=-1\\end{cases}$.","则 $|\\lambda E-A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&1&-4\\\\ 1&\\lambda-3&1\\\\ -4&1&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\\xrightarrow{r_{3}-r_{1}}\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&1&-4\\\\ 1&\\lambda-3&1\\\\ -4-\\lambda&0&\\lambda+4\\end{vmatrix}$","$\\xrightarrow{c_{1}+c_{3}}\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-4&1&-4\\\\ 2&\\lambda-3&1\\\\ 0&0&\\lambda+4\\end{vmatrix}=(\\lambda+4)\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-4&1\\\\ 2&\\lambda-3\\end{vmatrix}$","$=(\\lambda+4)((\\lambda-2)((\\lambda-5)=0$","$\\Rightarrow\\lambda_{1}=2, \\lambda_{2}=-4, \\lambda_{3}=5$","当 $\\lambda_{2}=-4$ 时，$-4E-A=\\begin{pmatrix}-4&1&-4\\\\ 1&-7&1\\\\ -4&1&-4\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{r_{1}\\leftrightarrow r_{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&-7&1\\\\ -4&1&-4\\\\ -4&1&-4\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow[r_{2}+4r_{1}]{r_{3}-r_{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&-7&1\\\\ 0&-27&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$,","其等价方程组为 $\\begin{cases}x_{1}-7x_{2}+x_{3}=0\\\\ -27x_{2}=0\\end{cases}$，由此得其基础解系含有 1 个解向量，即 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$.","当 $\\lambda_{3}=5$ 时，$5E-A=\\begin{pmatrix}5&1&-4\\\\ 1&2&1\\\\ -4&1&5\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{r_{1}\\leftrightarrow r_{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&1\\\\ 5&1&-4\\\\ -4&1&5\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow[r_{3}+4r_{1}]{r_{2}-5r_{1}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&1\\\\ 0&-9&-9\\\\ 0&9&9\\end{pmatrix}$","$\\xrightarrow{r_{3}-r_{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&1\\\\ 0&-9&-9\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{-\\frac{1}{9}r_{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&1\\\\ 0&1&1\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$","其等价方程组为 $\\begin{cases}x_{1}+2x_{2}+x_{3}=0\\\\ x_{2}+x_{3}=0\\end{cases}$.","由此得其基础解系含有一个解向量，即 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 1\\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}$ 把 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{2},\\boldsymbol{a}_{3}$ 单位化得:","$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$, $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 1\\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}$, 所以 $Q=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}&-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}&-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\\\ \\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{6}}&0&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}&-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\end{pmatrix}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-22","num":22,"desc":"边缘概率密度","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】由概率密度的性质 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x,y)dxdy=1$，可知","$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}Ae^{-2x^{2}+2xy-y^{2}}dxdy=A\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-x^{2}}dx\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}dy=1$,","又知 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-x^{2}}dx=\\sqrt{\\pi}$，有 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-x^{2}}dx\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}dy=\\pi$,","所以 $A=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}$，即 $f(x,y)=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-2x^{2}+2xy-y^{2}}$.","$X$ 的边缘概率密度为","$f_{X}(x)=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-x^{2}}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}dy=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-x^{2}}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-x^{2}}$, $-\\infty<x<+\\infty$,","$f_{Y|X}(y|x)=\\dfrac{f(x,y)}{f_{X}(x)}=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}e^{-2x^{2}+2xy-y^{2}}}{\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-x^{2}}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi}}e^{-(x-y)^{2}}$, $-\\infty<x<+\\infty$, $-\\infty<y<+\\infty$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2010-23","num":23,"desc":"联合分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2010数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【详解】（I）由题知 $X$ 的可能取值为 $0,1$；$Y$ 的可能取值为 $0,1,2$，则有","$P\\{X=0,Y=0\\}=\\dfrac{C_{3}^{2}}{C_{6}^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{5}$，$P\\{X=0,Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{C_{2}^{1}C_{3}^{1}}{C_{6}^{2}}=\\dfrac{2}{5}$","$P\\{X=0,Y=2\\}=\\dfrac{C_{2}^{2}}{C_{6}^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{15}$，$P\\{X=1,Y=0\\}=\\dfrac{C_{1}^{1}C_{3}^{1}}{C_{6}^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{5}$","$P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{C_{1}^{1}C_{2}^{1}}{C_{6}^{2}}=\\dfrac{2}{15}$，$P\\{X=1,Y=2\\}=0$","随机变量 $(X,Y)$ 的概率分布为","$\\begin{array}{c|ccc} X\\backslash Y & 0 & 1 & 2\\\\ \\hline 0 & \\dfrac{1}{5} & \\dfrac{2}{5} & \\dfrac{1}{15}\\\\ 1 & \\dfrac{1}{5} & \\dfrac{2}{15} & 0 \\end{array}$","（II）随机变量 $X,Y$ 的分布律分别为","$\\begin{array}{c|cc} X & 0 & 1\\\\ \\hline P & \\dfrac{2}{3} & \\dfrac{1}{3} \\end{array}$","$\\begin{array}{c|ccc} Y & 0 & 1 & 2\\\\ \\hline P & \\dfrac{2}{5} & \\dfrac{8}{15} & \\dfrac{1}{15} \\end{array}$","所以有","$EX=\\dfrac{1}{3}$, $EY=1\\times\\dfrac{8}{15}+2\\times\\dfrac{1}{15}=\\dfrac{2}{3}$,","$EXY=1\\times1\\times\\dfrac{2}{15}=\\dfrac{2}{15}$","$\\Rightarrow Cov(X,Y)=EXY-EXEY=-\\dfrac{4}{45}$"]}]}]}